Z||000000||Greg Piet||08-27-99||10:41 AM||||I have been on a hunt for replacing my headlight motors<br>I have heard<br>A)firebird 82-86 driverside=fiero passenger<br>and vice versa<br>B)for the gear contact Alan Mooty @ 407-275-5040 for bronze gears to replace the cruddy plastic ones in the early model (84-86) headlight motors at $45 a pop.  But hey it is bronze it shouldnt die as quickly at all!<br>C)Rodney Dickman has the rebushing kit for the second model headlight motors (do a web search)<p>There was a previous post about this and now I cant find it!<p>I hope this is helpful to all!
